                <pb facs="0520" n="400" xml:id="pg400"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">814.01/35a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Guatemala</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Whitehouse</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-01-06T18:00:00-05:00">January 6, 1931—6
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>3. You may extend the recognition of the Government of the United States to the
                    Government of Señor Andrade on the afternoon of January 8. Please inform your
                    Central American colleagues of the action you are taking in order that they may
                    join with you if they desire to do so.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
